{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_018B50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"高兴吧，Snake！我们成功开发出即食咖喱了！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"你说什么！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"开发起来可费了不少劲。毕竟我们只是靠着“美军口粮里用了真空包装香肠”这一条情报做出来的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"听说最难的是灭菌处理时温度和压力的调整。他们反复试验了很多次。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"蒸煮袋也是用于太空食品的技术。居然能靠自己把它开发出来，我们的人还真有两下子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"马上尝尝吧。现在把包装……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"等等，Snake！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":17,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"怎么了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"这东西要先用热水加热再吃。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"这样啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"要等3分钟哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":19,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"}]}